      {
        "id": "model-batch-shape-check",
        "moduleId": "softmax-normalization",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "模型补充：形状与归一化自检",
        "markdown": "若批量 $n=4$、特征 $d=5$、类别 $q=3$，则 $\\mathbf{X}\\mathbf{W}$ 是 $4\\times 3$，偏置 $\\mathbf{b}$ 是 $1\\times 3$，经广播相加后 $\\mathbf{O}$ 与 $\\hat{\\mathbf{Y}}$ 都是 $4\\times 3$。逐行归一化意味着每一行三个概率之和为 1，因此“每行求和是否都为 1、是否都没有负数”是检查实现是否正确的快捷方法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-batch-vectorization"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-maximum-likelihood",
        "moduleId": "cross-entropy-and-gradient",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：最大似然与负对数似然",
        "markdown": "把 $\\hat{y}_1$ 读作 $P(y=\\text{猫}\\mid\\mathbf{x})$，则数据集的条件似然为\n\n$$P(\\mathbf{Y}\\mid\\mathbf{X}) = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} P(\\mathbf{y}^{(i)}\\mid\\mathbf{x}^{(i)})$$\n\n最大似然估计要求最大化这一乘积，等价于最小化负对数似然：\n\n$$-\\log P(\\mathbf{Y}\\mid\\mathbf{X}) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} -\\log P(\\mathbf{y}^{(i)}\\mid\\mathbf{x}^{(i)}) = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} l(\\mathbf{y}^{(i)},\\hat{\\mathbf{y}}^{(i)})$$\n\n这与线性回归中使用的最大似然方法相同。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
